_blank" title="白宫称被禁媒体获准返回"&gt;重新允许进入白宫&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;特朗普的律师在一份&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/0HgT3aO9aBNvC2_KKJmPdQyhuXGKpmP7_04jH3U_UznvIdpFTKtBIRS5z0p_bcQHhVqfF2sUaxaxIYf9_1VTM2ucgeqFjPDqiLMB8oHcfBkUrDjG_Kp2oIMHeCok9utwcfzUoChAuvpQdclZzFSxEAMm7vKpB1HJ0GiW4sh8smeudHT-6KgyrOLflup48H6lXq3Nq2BboYVFcPIbSS5XaxmgWEKnM2cVZuaC7vHmPU69yb4Nn2b9rAZw9emkgIeKzy5h5ghN6PgRG6EYgfkNqoCBNRRpr3f_nhgM3ZwTq2viAa0msnplvc3totPhRlmeBuRhKm_F7av7ItCd2xyktQ/xsael4tnt3m1N1NI-0BTNFQpZ95Zfuwi/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank"&gt;法庭文件&lt;/a&gt;中表示，他们已经&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/QvAp-Fi3fbkG5QyHwxSIPyr0GPC6Pv7rhsQufJ0InwjuF-1CdxTsJ1H3vG31qUiSI4mhC94pNO17D-8RGMyKvoHaY_57_cIHICuo12vJi4whb8VkWzBzg0lbm7Z_o0imUh3zHummPJQffwm7Th1DiH3CN2xqAxsho1THYr9gzMs5LxMLKwt5YOHu15I_CFcTL6tbVPS1PWMySEt7gH2cRAvgRzvnoUuK0XVs8gZv4PZmkNvcQy7cDIa5932zLErL9Uf09hSIQ6ApZRkigkrWJhYxBak0HehgH8tkTZoszzGTdoAjq_qH6g1wVid-z3PtSymJmhi1Ov2IrgDQqOv4X2K7jH0HEjU2WLxnjP-LHAYP7Gd24KMhMaXy_hAqyviljzwItXRhaLpryHLv1MjxltYV9SfRLDLWAA6jpNUosM91DuxJ3sW0j3mdMrzoYNFBPAH8PnYOsgvdeCdeyJy1smsIdn7Qi17vadAHRNpPyixLoqlaeMzfM1N8pZcTCCjCdvElyhVmakxRToSa9L_fM_g/9qsWHyz06l-YAbSXOGyoKBR7jTjnFLPh/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="白宫称被禁媒体获准返回"&gt;恢复了对这些媒体的访问&lt;/a&gt;，总统上周禁止了这些媒体，这似乎违反了美国宪法。特朗普任命的美国地区法官蒂莫西·J·凯利(Timothy J. Kelly)连夜做出了对总统不利的裁决，此前他在第一届政府期间也曾放弃过类似的努力，他要求白宫对白宫无视他的命令的投诉做出回应。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;凯利表示，这些新闻机构达到了“高标准”，表明他们有可能在案件的是非曲直方面取得成功，理由是缺乏正当程序、侵犯宪法自由和整体公共利益。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top: 24px;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/UotxwOxBzT-CuXT9yariFM_UIxOwRexPwdtgqHoNmbDalmmvjUDPRRwGSUyTyWqqeoAT6Tx1b2XBDaRDbNM9Scc5hzuyzqhblkqfvT7ZnYBgCRnZ7TEkKEoFv1Atuc90jFId7YD4B_MFCrxYTa3xMwjNAW8rqhg36iiZDnAI4Zc2DUgH5qjjwBVVlsXITm6GWcCmCwV_oQcmdbFN6ztQaseOP_7LlnzR8GtD5XUy36k76