ortant;"&gt;特朗普支持的美国柴油出口禁令将至少在最初阶段降低价格&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style="line-height: 1.4; margin: 12px 0 0 0; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px !important;"&gt;分析师警告说，大约一个月后，情况将迅速恶化，因为储存的吸引力变得越来越小，利润受到挤压，并迫使炼油厂加工更少的原油，并减少生产各种燃料。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 40px; text-align: center; line-height: 40px; border: 1px solid; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px !important;"&gt;阅读更多&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;table align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-top: 20px;" width="auto"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align="center" style="padding: 0;" valign="top"&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/qiRaqfmnGHeSCXjm6mRQfOOml8Sx8haxXqiXTeadBIYkBy0nZcHN4QqWUDf7EL3rcrGkc0OVR2pMI50Oy8spnQ6lLt2a6zdaIjcYKFLICmIaSV2Mg1Wdfi_RnduUSR8Xpd1M_0Hm9mj-0v-_0Dg9BFq9awHLBeWKOgxc_Vvj-OmSUtToOcCWm1A0t74ztaj74JXtOz8516wdLFxpZszVgwD2oJRquvCCwpoCkdaxnuOIMuvHO6oy9985WztBHJSJjsOuoW_5xZmj8ov4sIfVksZkfnTkMWmgjj4U4Mj9jPF2LKiuQX30ShNr1hf6A7-yiRUESBE5lGpNNnEGv2M5RgzY8xhqaC1VurOmColwpTc7I72e8Quev0xagMHndAJyB-gHTFjAPyUBIBcQfDHItikrz9hus7JWZqw5MWBFJRloXjGlBRur5o-ZLcGdZhMp-DUBciSQVRl50nhGNQ/9Sl14sSnULCldKXhAA_MbVyKzS-YFdS_/24" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;img alt="替代" border="0" class="mq-lihide" src="https://sli.bloomberg.com/imp?s=1099794&amp;amp;stpe=default&amp;amp;li_coord=desktop&amp;amp;collapse_width=550&amp;amp;li=20035536&amp;amp;m=d42b0cd27465a66be4227a135cb7a14e&amp;amp;p=09242026211546&amp;amp;lctg=8b37da73-f2d1-4a1c-8a9f-cb9d10343de6" style="display: block; height: auto; width: 100%;" width="550" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align="center" valign="top"&gt;&lt;!--[if !mso]&gt;&lt;!--&gt;&lt;div class="mq-lishow" style="display: none; overflow: hidden; width: 0; line-height: 0;"&gt;&lt;table align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="auto"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align="center" style="padding: 0 0;" valign="top"&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.m