的额外费用，自 2017 年以来的数据显示，该现金总额首次飙升至每桶 5 美元以上。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;原油收盘上涨近 4%，至 103 美元左右，原因是美国柴油期货下跌， &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/ZLuPhPpgH2z5VXqGZc2BFQXYWyv3zoY1I3DIYIjxI_WQMqyt93b4v1HxV0Ldf6nPA-sy3RKu1te9DlVLHyArRMD0_a9VuSr32C3Xtjqelkf-sKKudjPoYDdPCxDaWnuaNK8AQJYDfDYx46MTCNt8bGgIQeQmoiUsNhkBZ-Ombh7mHcgZXXy9nl0AqzEskaylNzxK45cIk4BEZWt0CiBLYTKQ2ALQ8LjN5PnBBXYZFsytEwjlCAR3j4cbmdVNYBgOGneywovBMjo7TF7vOMkt6-DNQk7f8CV047KXm-FimOkbACIArh7vBz85LBj7tI-1JfXWKohmO1DCPYMylofFWINPuM1gHna2a1wqLmZd2CTqPzNU0Wx3wQSMeoBiBtpSotPPtYtObDtI_958z3Og5hrlaI1hjuqJsimomRyGF4NMoDTIAZHq473_w6h6gb_Reb1jHSrg19tay6XNC4TYHr0XRzF7t_Yl_OYYlJswNSIwhsxEDlpVKkBGwuJ8vTZIVGzM4VMH/Um-TLK_nrWxHjZn59qysxR3APbb8GMJP/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="尽管油价上涨，美国柴油期货仍因出口禁令担忧而暴跌"&gt;原因是人们猜测特朗普正在考虑实施出口禁令&lt;/a&gt;，而全球主要炼油厂基础设施仍处于离线状态。今年柴油价格上涨了 80% 以上，美国零售价格创下历史新高，令消费者在 11 月中期选举前感到沮丧。不断上升的能源成本也是美联储和其他寻求抑制通胀的央行头疼的问题。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top: 24px;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/0AlVGO1g27qe4Foljlbn37L4ENuiOrpY18kd3tAE1qNNLPA8Ul-dkKiF9ySqDqsus_s9AxcsfnABQG8DOIfEEQhGJWW3EM15ZWn7rHEU6FmrVcqEQEURdrxuf4PZ9hhN8W_AAj3668hRSonmpTDE_REydxL-j7llzY7sU-3Adqtn_vdjSaa1wyU3QYlynaNh01QlD7L5fxlo7Yi4q_J-62NsqIuhWdrH3f4cZhQMAC7DhlA_ivExcLqOjgramkiRum0P9iHlEwe3PC8wGYzirZcIOzOLtixntRcThAdDRmOKGerYDX80N9XkFtCbP-Di5QXzG_2CcyVRfC_Dy3SYgfjpiUhpZ3JzbfENdQNzGl2uqclQDxi3KuDiPGMW5FGI6Nq2x5T5xtFxz9jlmibyV-7sI2en5ziU2QpurkrL4RJXcXJJYt83Dv6ArKmY2Bgyb0v8Yj5q65YFD4_xK8LxzQka2IfD9_ZBrNJp_63JauELpIbjAc-8UTGvYASuUrte6u6N5LBIQdl-GR6aAM1mQefT1UJAIQ/4xtGeykEhTQEHJ0dyVEC49y_XQmGkzZH/24" style="font-size: inherit; color: inherit; text-decoration: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;div style="border-top: 1px solid; margin: 0 0 24px 0;"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="line-height: normal; margin: 12px 0 0 0; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px !important;"&gt;泡沫恐惧&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 style="line-height: normal; font-weight: 700; margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 20px !important;"&gt;随着对冲需求飙升，英伟达跻身顶级掉期行列&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style="line-height: 1.4; margin: 12px 0 0 0; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px !important;"&gt;对信用违约掉期的需求来自于投资者，他们希望对冲与超大规模企业相关的债务不断增加带来的潜在损失。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 40px; text-align: center; line-height: 40px; border: 1px solid; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px !important;"&gt;阅读更多&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="border-top: 1px solid; margin: 24px 0 0 0;"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top: 24px;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/X9DuuX-B-KbA75uhZwLN5SFqTYx1fMJ2fbS4fpuJ_iWvgd0W6TV9Q6EoIpekS7NlKZgaftm77EGPXBhxDWbybIiv8tt7YT9a3CQ6QvsEyObjjRaao4YAu6ZTBKXIyieD2De3bf2zRp4WKIpJ7tLZb6qGly4HgVIt3g0F4mi5B93-Dao9dGujfGyg5zwUS2bymt0PuXIqFr-Lmgg9w_6-bZrJD_HhrnKkeRxluibEaikotK0XFihjxNWrEedolJiNMQmki3F5jWxmIgFRvp66h9qyEBGj4lFPq0nZQvptCCV1RyRwpI-HEpl5q-1ZahXFyPDBks7QXRXyoBB93CGkjNuwqIygw6_EHc-xYoD7E5xY9G7el_VwCLAZ0qZNClUnBva1qnKaULy-VtZKPJ5r4rhQ-ZCdHG7Ou8-hdxtQGeWSOJRSAm-Zxdec2s9OHSM-q6xL6Wu8VZfoO0StU9WasmIEb7nusvn9_39W7l4hkAhr/qA6qDVhQhQtUoJkRkqUd-Rl7EUMHzs_a/24" style="font-size: inherit; color: inherit; text-decoration: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;table width="580"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iliEaIWGtMHE/v0/-1x-1.jpg" alt=" " width="580"/&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div style="display:none"&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;img alt="" src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iliEaIWGtMHE/v0/-1x-1.jpg" style="width: 100%; display: block;" /&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="line-height: normal; margin: 12px 0 0 0; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px !important;"&gt;人工智能&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 style="line-height: normal; font-weight: 700; margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 20px !impo