&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;美国数据中心将大量电力转化为废热，导致附近社区的气温升高。随着人工智能的繁荣推动更大的电力使用，成本和有限的激励措施减缓了冷却替代方案的采用。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;集群效应&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div style="margin-left: 8px; margin-right: 8px;"&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 24px 0 0; text-align: center; font-size: 32px;"&gt; 11%&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 8px;"&gt;预计 2040 年以集群方式构建的&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/jYs0pLu_0vy1fVk1pqt_w4Apl0dN1dQ52YAshe-C_AuWQpQ1znG5VNB-2-ly28KobBaZaAXlTxkHKkK2ki-WvO5Y1s_7swgo5NCFe_fUg1kXcXaDnd_eran_-BCGQq0_ie_7X1ncu_LqSsPaEpSFLc83XBrHfLGxbPNVZWeW_Q5jsjdkSHWdMqBRSJe39GXSo0IDslpJKGwyubsgFGuxjexQTmOf_DUpmg_BZtB4xjdqMV1w5fq4O08j-oNR7GthpL7gyqfqt31D_UnCCMeDv0VwEY4DPmZXRc-GmB1gts8Ls7pXI11A6GOIyj4sHhdCPNb3K33KxU0MuzGqVJBDx8iPGjyq-IRIw7L0Gsq6BLhyLGC3zVAI993uTA3DxMqdeIsCybw_TwXiEvP1OXbZVpa_YAMam293qPyygJ8acVKiJH4bbrcv7Hk3ZDAI8ax05qvt5_yATsIQqhZYMLwgvWmF0DpdP3pOb1NMlBxLU49QE9RD6w6Uhj3k6PHvA3MzejHGYXs/WGmqm9CccYVbWXfvn80MyiYhc5viMeTJ/24" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="AI数据中心释放热量，给城市带来新问题"&gt;数据中心总容量&lt;/a&gt;所占份额&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 30px; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 40px;"&gt;即将沸腾&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top: 24px; margin-left: 8px; margin-right: 8px;"&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: center; font-size: 22px; margin: 0;"&gt; “热量是&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/8Tsr416hnLcHtc4j0oE33XPhGybVGE0N_sRrN_tKmJb8FHuIIdpUJcqoy004Dg2XX3ZaJOa2fYDGp3CKxAzGUA_nEKzOqlO16s5zNWaNXzXBaAbfBnV_9pzX_8GllfKu_MLDANwhgGGSBNtlsZDprMtzWvYLQRwPvCz5Vyr_4STaQOAEQLRfwBnJm483vrr8XOkJzQIeUxybjHrs3wqk-WWdHG0n1PJcorQcyMfL36lDtX5r5T40RZ12fk1gOg17V4K4K6OGvCZ0qzfB1KD3wsr9xJFROug1FbXiQSNFEMPAnKa2LVwL-428kj6W7vnUGOorVX9oZxg4gJzT5HDuGrUQGVslsLOeN2SBKZEDxRujuNGRYsXydmz-9ec4